        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="ECf 20.1a"><pb n="645" ed="#liebermann"/>Quodsi aufugeret<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="23" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.23"/>, et dicerent, quod non possent<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="24" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.24"/> habere<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="7" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.7"/> eum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="25" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.25"/> ad<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="22" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.22"/> rectum, daretur eis terminus<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="26" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.26"/> a iusticia<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="27" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.27"/> regis<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="28" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.28"/> triginta<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="k" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.fn.k"/> dierum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="29" target="#ECf_20-1a.lnote.la.29"/> et unius diei.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="645"><label>printed alongside</label> <ref target="clause:ECfRetr_20-1a">ECf retr 20.1a</ref></note>
